  "goodToKnow": "Die Befristung is a time limit, especially for employment: a befristeter Arbeitsvertrag ends on a set date. Without a specific reason, contracts may be fixed-term for at most two years. In academia, the #IchBinHanna campaign protested against endless Befristungen under the Wissenschaftszeitvertragsgesetz. The opposite is unbefristet (permanent). Plural: die Befristungen."
